  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Irrigation and Drainage Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Adecuacin de Tierras</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROGRAM WILL SUPPORT GOC STRATEGY IN THE IRRIGATION AND DRAINAGE SECTOR, THRU A TIME-SLICE OPERATION THAT WILL FINANCE A SLICE OF THE INVESTMENT PROGRAM AND THE IMPLEMENTATION OF A NEW SECTORAL POLICY TO SCREEN, APPRAISE AND FINANCE DEMAND-DRIVEN PROJECTS. THE PROGRAM WILL ALSO CONTRIBUTE TO TRAIN IRRIGATION DISTRICT FARMERS SO AS TO INCREASE PRODUCTIVITY AND AVOID DEGRADATION OF NATURAL RESOURCES.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
